      questionZh: '為何相鄰波瓣的粒子反相振動？波節的相位是甚麼？',
      reasoning: [
        { en: 'A stationary mode has fixed nodes dividing it into loops; within one loop the non-node particles move through corresponding stages of their cycle together.', zh: '駐波模態的固定波節把介質分成波瓣；同一波瓣內的非波節粒子同時經歷各自週期的相應階段。' },
        { en: 'The next loop has the opposite displacement and velocity signs at corresponding times, so its positive extreme coincides with the first loop’s negative extreme.', zh: '相鄰波瓣在相應時刻的位移及速度符號相反，故其正向極值與前一波瓣的負向極值同時出現。' },
        { en: 'Those opposite stages differ by half a cycle, giving antiphase; amplitude differences within a loop do not imply a phase difference.', zh: '這兩個相反階段相差半個週期，因此為反相；同一波瓣內振幅不同並不表示相位不同。' },
        { en: 'A node has zero amplitude and never completes an oscillation, so no oscillation phase can be assigned to it.', zh: '波節振幅為零，根本沒有進行振動，故不能為它指定位移振動相位。' },
      ],
      modelAnswer: 'In a stationary mode, all non-node particles in the same loop reach their respective positive extremes together and therefore oscillate in phase, even though their amplitudes differ. In an adjacent loop the displacements and velocities have opposite signs at corresponding times: when one loop is at its positive extreme, the next is at its negative extreme. The oscillations differ by half a cycle and are in antiphase. At a node the resultant displacement remains zero at all times, so the particle does not oscillate and its phase is undefined.',
      modelAnswerZh: '同一駐波模態中，同一波瓣內的非波節粒子同時到達各自的正向極值，所以即使振幅不同，仍是同相振動。相鄰波瓣在相應時刻的位移及速度符號相反：一個波瓣達正向極值時，下一個達負向極值。兩者相差半個週期，故反相振動。波節的合位移在任何時刻均為零，粒子不振動，因此其振動相位未有定義。',
      pitfalls: [
        { en: 'Do not assign “zero phase” to a node. Undefined phase is different from a defined phase of zero.', zh: '不可說波節有「零相位」；未定義相位與已定義且數值為零的相位是不同概念。' },
        { en: 'Same instantaneous displacement does not prove equal phase; compare the stage and direction of oscillation.', zh: '某一瞬間位移相同不能證明同相；須比較振動階段及運動方向。' },
      ],
